    "description": "Nestled in coveted Presidio Heights just blocks from Laurel Village and the Presidio this timeless Victorian triplex debuts after 60+ years in one beloved family. With two vacant units, it's an ideal opportunity for owner-occupants, multi-generational living or income-minded investors.  Rich in character, the home blends original charm, soaring ceilings, stained glass, chair rails, and tile in lays with fresh updates like new paint, flooring, and lighting.  The top floor offers a flexible layout: enjoy as one expansive residence or split into two. A charming pied--terre features a sunny living room with stained glass and fireplace, eat-in kitchen, full bath, and spacious bedroom with pocket parlor doors. The adjoining 3BD/2.25BA unit boasts a sunlit living room, wood-accented dining room, and kitchen with 5-burner stove, wok station, and breakfast nook. Upstairs, two dormer bedrooms, a skylit bath, and a kitchenette complete a tranquil upper level.  The ground floor includes a shared laundry, bonus room for gym/studio/workshop use, and access to a multi-tiered backyard with drip irrigation. A 2-car tandem garage with epoxy floors and storage completes the offering.  Moments from top dining, boutiques, and parks, with easy access to the GGB and public transit."
  },
